<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>数独规则 / Sudoku Rules</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimSun", Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #2c5aa0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2c5aa0;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #2c5aa0;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .section {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #2c5aa0;
        }
        .en {
            color: #555;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .zh {
            color: #333;
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        ul {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }
        li {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>数独规则 / Sudoku Rules</h1>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>游戏简介 / Game Introduction</h2>
        <p class="zh">数独是一种逻辑填数游戏，玩家需要在 9×9 的网格中填入数字 1-9，使得每行、每列和每个 3×3 的小方格内都包含 1-9 的所有数字，且不重复。</p>
        <p class="en">Sudoku is a logic-based number placement puzzle. Players must fill a 9×9 grid with digits 1-9 so that each row, each column, and each of the nine 3×3 subgrids contains all digits from 1 to 9 without repetition.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>基本规则 / Basic Rules</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>行规则：</strong>每一行必须包含数字 1-9，不能重复。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Row Rule:</strong> Each row must contain digits 1-9 without repetition.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>列规则：</strong>每一列必须包含数字 1-9，不能重复。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Column Rule:</strong> Each column must contain digits 1-9 without repetition.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>宫规则：</strong>每个 3×3 的小方格（宫）必须包含数字 1-9，不能重复。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Box Rule:</strong> Each 3×3 subgrid (box) must contain digits 1-9 without repetition.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>游戏目标 / Game Objective</h2>
        <p class="zh">根据已知的数字提示，通过逻辑推理填满整个 9×9 网格，使所有行、列和宫都满足规则要求。每个数独谜题都有且仅有一个唯一解。</p>
        <p class="en">Fill the entire 9×9 grid through logical deduction based on the given number clues, ensuring all rows, columns, and boxes satisfy the rules. Each Sudoku puzzle has exactly one unique solution.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>难度等级 / Difficulty Levels</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>简单：</strong>给出较多已知数字，适合初学者。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Easy:</strong> More given numbers, suitable for beginners.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>中等：</strong>需要基本的逻辑推理技巧。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Medium:</strong> Requires basic logical reasoning skills.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>困难：</strong>需要高级推理技巧和策略。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Hard:</strong> Requires advanced reasoning techniques and strategies.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>专家：</strong>极具挑战性，需要复杂的解题方法。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Expert:</strong> Highly challenging, requires complex solving methods.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>常用技巧 / Common Techniques</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>唯一候选数：</strong>当某个格子只能填一个数字时，直接填入。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Naked Single:</strong> When a cell has only one possible candidate, fill it in directly.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>隐性唯一数：</strong>当某个数字在某行/列/宫中只有一个可填位置时，填入该数字。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Hidden Single:</strong> When a digit has only one possible position in a row/column/box, place it there.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh"><strong>排除法：</strong>通过已填数字排除同行、同列、同宫的可能数字。</span><br>
                <span class="en"><strong>Elimination:</strong> Eliminate possibilities by checking filled numbers in the same row, column, and box.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>注意事项 / Tips</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <span class="zh">数独不需要数学计算，完全依靠逻辑推理。</span><br>
                <span class="en">Sudoku requires no mathematical calculation; it relies entirely on logical reasoning.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh">不要猜测，每个填入的数字都应该有逻辑依据。</span><br>
                <span class="en">Don't guess; every number placed should have logical justification.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="zh">如果卡住，尝试换个角度观察或使用 pencil marks（候选数标记）。</span><br>
                <span class="en">If stuck, try a different perspective or use pencil marks to note candidates.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #888; font-size: 0.9em;">
        <p class="zh">祝您游戏愉快！</p>
        <p class="en">Enjoy the game!</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
